{
  "id": "the-simpsons---7x09---sideshow-bobs-last-gleaming",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 7x09 - Sideshow Bob's Last Gleaming",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 7x09 - Sideshow Bob's Last Gleaming.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T21:02:58.811Z",
  "lineCount": 281,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "The Simpsons",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 3903,
      "endMs": 7202
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 15415,
      "endMs": 17508
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "I'd like to thank everybody who contributed to Krusty's Canned Food Drive.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 33433,
      "endMs": 37767
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Your generous donations... have made this our slipperiest, slimiest slobstacle course ever!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 37871,
      "endMs": 44343
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Our contestants will drop out of my nose and blurp into a tub of refried beans.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 46980,
      "endMs": 52043
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "From there, they'll stumble down a sluice of rich, eggy b�arnaise sauce.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 54120,
      "endMs": 58921
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "How can we afford it? It's rancid! Uhh- And at the finish line... a scrumptious parfait of pudding, pickle brine and detergent... where a writhing pile of kids will grope blindly for hot dogs!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 59025,
      "endMs": 72872
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Krusty, please! It burns!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 72972,
      "endMs": 75702
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Oh, just think, Lise. That's our pickle brine burning Sideshow Mel.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 78111,
      "endMs": 81137
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "That Sideshow Mel thinks he's so big.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 81247,
      "endMs": 83909
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Whatever happened to Sideshow Bob?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 84017,
      "endMs": 85985
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "Don't you remember, Dad?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 86086,
      "endMs": 87986
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "He framed Krusty, he tried to kill Aunt Selma... he rigged an election- And he tried to murder me.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 88088,
      "endMs": 95394
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Oh, yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 95495,
      "endMs": 97395
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "But what I'll mainly remember is the laughter. I wonder what he's doing now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 97497,
      "endMs": 101991
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "Ah, Westminster Abbey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 104304,
      "endMs": 106864
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Edward the Confessor himself could not have done better.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 106973,
      "endMs": 109908
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "Now to set the clocks to Greenwich mean time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 110009,
      "endMs": 113410
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "My dear abbey!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 115515,
      "endMs": 118484
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "This is the way we mop the floor, mop the floor mop the floor Oh, must you bray night and day at that infernal television?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 122055,
      "endMs": 129856
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Oh, look who's talking. Yeah, Bob. You used to be on this show.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 129963,
      "endMs": 133797
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Don't remind me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 133900,
      "endMs": 135800
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "My foolish capering destroyed more young minds than syphilis and pinball combined.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 135902,
      "endMs": 140669
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Oh, how I loathe that box... that omnidirectional sludge pump droning and burping- Look here! That's enough now! I own 60% of that network!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 140773,
      "endMs": 151942
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "All right, break it up, boys. It's time for work detail.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 152051,
      "endMs": 154918
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "I suppose you don't like tabloid newspapers either.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 155021,
      "endMs": 158548
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "There. That's the last condom wrapper.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 165265,
      "endMs": 168530
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Oh, I renew my objection to this pointless endeavor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 171571,
      "endMs": 175974
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Informally now and by affidavit later, time permitting.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 176075,
      "endMs": 178908
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Shut your word-hole! We gotta get this place clean for the air show.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 179012,
      "endMs": 182778
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "Air show? Buzz-cut Alabamians spewing colored smoke from their whizz jets... to the strains of \"Rock You Like a Hurricane\"?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 182882,
      "endMs": 191419
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "What kind of country-fried rube is still impressed by that?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 191524,
      "endMs": 195517
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Yeah! Yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 199232,
      "endMs": 201166
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "I want to meet the first female stealth bomber pilot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 201267,
      "endMs": 203428
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "During the Gulf War, she destroyed 70 mosques. And her name is Lisa too.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 203536,
      "endMs": 207302
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "I want to see some birds get sucked into the engines, rare ones.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 207407,
      "endMs": 210865
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "This year I'm making ear plugs out of biscuit dough.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 210977,
      "endMs": 214208
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "They're ready.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 214314,
      "endMs": 216646
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "So weary.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 218618,
      "endMs": 221883
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Grandma, this is my friend, Craig.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 227227,
      "endMs": 229718
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "Friend? You mean you two aren't knocking boots?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 231965,
      "endMs": 234661
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "Ever do the back-seat mambo, Craigie?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 237503,
      "endMs": 239664
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "I know that voice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 239772,
      "endMs": 241672
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "TV's bottomless chum bucket has claimed Vanessa Redgrave!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 241774,
      "endMs": 245972
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "Now I'm gonna haul ass to Lollapalooza.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 246079,
      "endMs": 248809
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Yee-haw.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 248915,
      "endMs": 251748
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Farewell, dear 'Nessa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 251851,
      "endMs": 254183
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Hey, you.! The state's not paying you five cents an hour to stand around.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 260760,
      "endMs": 264696
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Now, get busy! Oh, I'll get busy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 264797,
      "endMs": 267425
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "I'll get very busy, indeed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 267533,
      "endMs": 269899
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "You still got it, Bob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 276542,
      "endMs": 278533
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Way to guard the parking lot, Top Gun!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 280480,
      "endMs": 282505
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "I have three medals for this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 282615,
      "endMs": 284606
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Hey! Where is Sideshow Bob and that guy who, uh, eats people and takes their faces?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 288187,
      "endMs": 291645
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "I'm right here, Chief. Oh. Then where's Sideshow Bob?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 291758,
      "endMs": 294989
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "Uh, he ran off. Oh, great.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 295094,
      "endMs": 298086
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "Well, if anyone asks, uh, I beat him to death, okay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 298197,
      "endMs": 302531
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "Right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 302635,
      "endMs": 304603
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "At this point in time, I would like to direct your attention... to the particular air vehicle next to which I am currently standing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 310243,
      "endMs": 315577
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "The Harrier jet is one of our more dollar-intensive, ordnance-delivery vectors.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 315682,
      "endMs": 319482
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Five tires? Am I seeing things?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 319585,
      "endMs": 322019
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Uh, and although it looks complicated... it's so well-designed, even a child could fly it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 322121,
      "endMs": 326387
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "Can I fly it? Of course you cannot.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 326492,
      "endMs": 328460
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "Free Duff? Viva life!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 331698,
      "endMs": 335259
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Mm. Uhh-",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 341908,
      "endMs": 344502
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Take that, Mom!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 350116,
      "endMs": 352175
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Take that, Dad!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 352285,
      "endMs": 354515
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Send me to a psychiatrist, will you?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 354620,
      "endMs": 357145
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "Take that, Dr. Sally Waxler!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 357256,
      "endMs": 359884
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Uh, Colonel, they're expecting you at the podium in 10 minutes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 367166,
      "endMs": 369726
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "I'm, uh-",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 369836,
      "endMs": 372999
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Hmm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 382615,
      "endMs": 384879
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "What in the World According to Garp?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 386052,
      "endMs": 389078
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Those are my dress towels!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 389188,
      "endMs": 391349
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "Who's in my private washroom? McGuckett, let me in.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 392692,
      "endMs": 396458
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "The door already is closed. What?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 396562,
      "endMs": 399190
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "This is Colonel Leslie \"Hap\" Hapablap.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 399298,
      "endMs": 401994
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "If you don't open that door, I'll tear you up like a Kleenex at a snot party!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 402101,
      "endMs": 406697
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "You say you're in the military?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 406806,
      "endMs": 408603
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Sweet Enola Gay, son! I'm gonna come in there and corpse you up!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 408708,
      "endMs": 412804
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Corpse you up and mail you to mama!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 412912,
      "endMs": 415813
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "Well, where'd he go?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 417483,
      "endMs": 420350
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Oh, got my knuckles all lined up for nothing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 420453,
      "endMs": 424549
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Sorry, ladies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 426659,
      "endMs": 428627
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "Look at that hunk of junk. Not jun- You're ignorant! That's the Wright Brothers' plane.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 432965,
      "endMs": 440172
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "At Kitty Hawk in 1903...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 440273,
      "endMs": 442366
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Charles Lindbergh flew it 15 miles on a thimbleful of corn oil.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 442475,
      "endMs": 447174
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Single-handedly won us the Civil War, it did.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 447280,
      "endMs": 449908
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "So, how do you know so much about American history?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 450016,
      "endMs": 451984
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "I pieced it together mostly from sugar packets.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 452084,
      "endMs": 454917
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "Authorization code?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 458357,
      "endMs": 461155
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Code? Son, this is Colonel Hapablap!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 461260,
      "endMs": 463524
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "That fool McGuckett sprayed runway foam all over Chuck Yeager's Acura.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 463629,
      "endMs": 467429
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Now get down there with the chamois triple-time!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 467533,
      "endMs": 469626
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "But, Colonel, I'm under strict orders to- Sweet Enola Gay, son!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 469735,
      "endMs": 472568
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Get moving or I'll tear you up like a Kleenex at a, uh, snot party.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 472672,
      "endMs": 477371
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Sir, right away, sir!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 477477,
      "endMs": 479172
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "They didn't have any aspirin, so I got you some cigarettes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 486519,
      "endMs": 488817
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "Maybe my headache will go away once the show starts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 488921,
      "endMs": 493187
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "Uh, ladies and gentlemen... what a day for an air show!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 493292,
      "endMs": 500228
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Not a cloud in the sky.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 500333,
      "endMs": 503359
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Except perhaps... a mushroom cloud.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 503469,
      "endMs": 506961
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Oh, forget it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 515848,
      "endMs": 519648
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "To slip the surly bonds of Earth... and touch the face of God.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 522154,
      "endMs": 528222
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "To fly!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 528327,
      "endMs": 530227
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "The dream of man and flightless bird alike.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 530329,
      "endMs": 533662
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "And now, hold on tight... as we blast through the thrilling highlights of aviation history!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 533766,
      "endMs": 540996
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Say! Did somebody say box kites? No.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 544210,
      "endMs": 548408
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "The common box kite was originally used as a means of drying wet string.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 551417,
      "endMs": 557014
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Do they have to play that rock music?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 567867,
      "endMs": 570199
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Every note is pounding into my skull.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 570303,
      "endMs": 573431
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Anybody out there feel the need for speed?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 579078,
      "endMs": 582104
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "Yay! Yay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 582214,
      "endMs": 584307
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Then get ready for the pride of the United States Air Force!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 584417,
      "endMs": 588410
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "The British-made HarrierJump jet!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 588521,
      "endMs": 591888
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "Dad, why aren't you looking?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 594727,
      "endMs": 596991
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "Why jerk my neck around like a goon... when Tyranno-Vision decides what I should look at?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 597096,
      "endMs": 602192
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Ooh, look! It's Maggie!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 602301,
      "endMs": 606567
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Uh, Maggie?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 606672,
      "endMs": 608936
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "Sideshow Bob!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 609041,
      "endMs": 611339
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Hello, Springfield.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 611444,
      "endMs": 613412
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Sorry to divert your attention from all the big noises and shiny things.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 613512,
      "endMs": 618381
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "But something's been troubling me lately- television!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 618484,
      "endMs": 622250
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Wouldn't our lives be so much richer if television were done away with?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 622355,
      "endMs": 626587
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "What? Surely he's not talking about VH1?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 626692,
      "endMs": 630025
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "Why, we could revive the lost arts of conversation... and scrimshaw.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 630129,
      "endMs": 635192
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Thus I submit to you, we abolish television... permanently!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 635301,
      "endMs": 639738
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Go back to Massachusetts, pinko!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 639839,
      "endMs": 642433
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Oh, and one more thing. I've stolen a nuclear weapon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 642541,
      "endMs": 646068
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "If you do not rid this city of television within two hours...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 646178,
      "endMs": 649545
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "I will detonate it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 649649,
      "endMs": 651549
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Farewell.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 651651,
      "endMs": 655747
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "By the way, I'm aware of the irony of appearing on TV in order to decry it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 655855,
      "endMs": 659586
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "So don't bother pointing that out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 659692,
      "endMs": 662126
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Kids, everything's gonna be okay! Don't panic! Just don't panic!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 664063,
      "endMs": 667089
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Mom! Mom, you're stepping on my heels and knocking my shoes off!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 667199,
      "endMs": 670259
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "We can always get more shoes. Move, move, move!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 670369,
      "endMs": 672394
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "Stamp your hand for reentry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 674707,
      "endMs": 676902
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Hey!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 679011,
      "endMs": 680911
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "Cool! I want to be around when those guns start going off.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 681013,
      "endMs": 684881
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Bart! No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 684984,
      "endMs": 687817
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "Wait! Wait! My children are in there! You must be very proud, ma'am.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 687920,
      "endMs": 691913
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "Our city will not negotiate with terrorists.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 695327,
      "endMs": 698194
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Is there a city nearby that will?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 698297,
      "endMs": 700492
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "No need, sir. We'll find that head case faster than Garfield finds lasagna.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 700599,
      "endMs": 705195
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Oh. I'm sorry. My- My wife thought that was gangbusters.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 705304,
      "endMs": 710071
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "This elevator only goes to the basement.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 715648,
      "endMs": 718742
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "And someone made an awful mess down there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 718851,
      "endMs": 722412
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "Watch out.! He's got his probe.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 725991,
      "endMs": 727959
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "Bart! Bart! What are you doing? We've got to get out of here!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 733132,
      "endMs": 737228
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "Target sighted! Launching air-to-nerd missile!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 737336,
      "endMs": 739497
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "Ow! Come on! Mom and Dad are waiting!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 739605,
      "endMs": 742938
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "Bob is not here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 743042,
      "endMs": 744907
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "We have searched every square inch of this base... and all we have found is porno, porno, porno!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 745010,
      "endMs": 751278
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "We have only 20 minutes left.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 752585,
      "endMs": 754485
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "Send in the esteemed representatives of television.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 754587,
      "endMs": 756953
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Hey, hey! Now, this is my kind of meeting!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 761327,
      "endMs": 764728
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Gentlemen, it's time we face up to the un-face-up-to-able.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 764830,
      "endMs": 769062
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "We must sacrifice television in order to save the lives of our townspeople.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 769168,
      "endMs": 773696
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "Whoa! Whoa-ho-ho! Let's not go nuts!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 773806,
      "endMs": 778266
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Would it really be worth living in a world without television?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 778377,
      "endMs": 781869
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "I think the survivors would envy the dead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 781981,
      "endMs": 785439
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "I appreciate your passion on behalf of your medium.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 785551,
      "endMs": 790045
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "But I'm afraid we're out of options.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 790156,
      "endMs": 792784
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "Television must go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 792892,
      "endMs": 794985
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "May God have mercy on our souls.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 795094,
      "endMs": 798495
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "And as my final newscast draws to a close...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 805070,
      "endMs": 807061
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "I'm reminded of a few of the events that brought me closer to you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 807173,
      "endMs": 809937
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "The collapse of the Soviet Union, premium ice cream price wars... dogs that were mistakenly issued major credit cards and others who weren't so lucky.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 810042,
      "endMs": 818242
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "And so, farewell.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 818350,
      "endMs": 820784
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Uh, and, uh, don't forget to look for my new column in PC World magazine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 820886,
      "endMs": 825516
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Success! They're giving in!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 836569,
      "endMs": 840471
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "Blast! I should have made more demands!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 840573,
      "endMs": 844703
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "Some decent local marmalade, for one. Oh, well, next time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 844810,
      "endMs": 848109
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Not my extendo-glove!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 848214,
      "endMs": 850478
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Oh, they haven't made those since the war.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 850583,
      "endMs": 852847
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "Not- Oh, not my Paris backdrop!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 852952,
      "endMs": 855580
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "How am I gonna make fun of the Frogs?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 855688,
      "endMs": 859146
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Wait.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 859258,
      "endMs": 861920
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "If I could only stay on the air...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 862027,
      "endMs": 864291
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "I'd have 100% of the audience.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 864396,
      "endMs": 866864
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "Think of the ratings.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 866966,
      "endMs": 869196
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "Okay, so we can't go over the fence.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 871637,
      "endMs": 873628
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "I feel so helpless. What if something happens to them?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 873739,
      "endMs": 876640
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "I'm sure they're fine, honey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 876742,
      "endMs": 878676
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "Hmm. Well, at least they're wearing clean underwear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 878777,
      "endMs": 881439
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "Free and easy, Lise.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 886151,
      "endMs": 888312
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "There's nothing like an unfurnished basement for pure comfort.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 888420,
      "endMs": 891753
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Huh? Hurry up. Mom and Dad are probably worried sick.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 891857,
      "endMs": 895384
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Do you know what really frosts my Kelvinator?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 895494,
      "endMs": 899521
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "That fruitcup's probably still laughing at us from his damn hidey-hole.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 899632,
      "endMs": 903227
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "I'd rather take an order from Bill Clinton... than hear that guy's snooty, high-toned voice again, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 903335,
      "endMs": 908430
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "\"High-toned voice. \" Bart, that's it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 908540,
      "endMs": 912135
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "I know where Sideshow Bob is hiding.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 912244,
      "endMs": 914235
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "When Bob broadcast that message, his voice was higher than normal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 914346,
      "endMs": 918715
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "And what makes your voice high?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 918817,
      "endMs": 920785
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Tight, binding underwear? Helium!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 920886,
      "endMs": 923446
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Sideshow Bob is in the Duff blimp!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 923555,
      "endMs": 925648
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "All Springfield trembles before the might of Sideshow Bob.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 927793,
      "endMs": 933288
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Blasted helium! Shoo! Shoo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 933399,
      "endMs": 936129
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "Shoo! Shoo! That's better.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 936235,
      "endMs": 938931
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "Gone. Gone too. Fabulous. Marvelous.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 939038,
      "endMs": 943338
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "This is the emergency broadcast system.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 943442,
      "endMs": 946002
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Stand by for an urgent bulletin.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 946111,
      "endMs": 948011
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "Hey, hey!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 948113,
      "endMs": 951139
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Krusty the Clown is back on the air!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 951250,
      "endMs": 953411
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Eight- No, no! Twelve hours a day!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 953519,
      "endMs": 956181
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "The only game in town!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 956288,
      "endMs": 958449
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Krusty! But how?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 958557,
      "endMs": 961025
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "Coming at you live from the civil defense shack... in the remote Alkali Flats of the Springfield badlands.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 961126,
      "endMs": 967522
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "I'll be beaming out 11 watts of wackiness!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 967633,
      "endMs": 970864
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Hour after hour of unscripted, unrehearsed comedy... featuring, uh, you know, uh, Professor Gas Can!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 970970,
      "endMs": 978608
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Uh, and, uh, former president, Ike Eisenhower!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 978711,
      "endMs": 982807
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "Let's get busy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 982915,
      "endMs": 985042
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Oh! My utopia lies in ruins.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 985150,
      "endMs": 989052
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "How naive of me to think a mere atom bomb could fell the chattering Cyclops!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 989154,
      "endMs": 994786
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Well, at least I'll have my revenge!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1000666,
      "endMs": 1004432
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Bob, no!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1004536,
      "endMs": 1005730
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Don't you see? That would be taking the easy way out.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1005838,
      "endMs": 1008705
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "I agree.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1008807,
      "endMs": 1012038
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "\"Best before November 1959.\" Damn it, Bob!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1029928,
      "endMs": 1033659
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "There were plenty of brand-new bombs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1033766,
      "endMs": 1035666
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "But you had to go for that retro '50s charm.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1035768,
      "endMs": 1038259
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "Well, if it isn't my arch nemesis, Bart Simpson... and his sister, Lisa, to whom I'm fairly indifferent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1040272,
      "endMs": 1046939
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "So Krusty double-crossed you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1047046,
      "endMs": 1049071
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "But your basic plan was pure genius.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1049181,
      "endMs": 1052014
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Where do you get your ideas?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1052117,
      "endMs": 1054847
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "Oh, please! Let's not embarrass us both... with that hoary old stall-the-villain-with-flattery scheme.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1054953,
      "endMs": 1061016
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "I- I should've known you were too smart to fall for that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1062561,
      "endMs": 1065724
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Really? What type of smart? Book smart?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1065831,
      "endMs": 1067958
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Because there are a lot of people who are book smart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1068067,
      "endMs": 1070297
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "But it takes a very special type of genius to- All right, Bob. It's over.! Come out with your hands up.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1070402,
      "endMs": 1075440
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "No! How did they find me?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1075541,
      "endMs": 1078704
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "He's getting away!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1095094,
      "endMs": 1098427
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Oh, not the Harrier! We've got a war tomorrow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1098530,
      "endMs": 1103331
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "God bless the idiot-proof Air Force.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1103435,
      "endMs": 1106268
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "They're gone!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1111910,
      "endMs": 1115038
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "Hell! Not the Wright Brothers' plane.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1115147,
      "endMs": 1117945
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "The Smithsonian's gonna have my ass on a platter.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1118050,
      "endMs": 1120814
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Dad! Help!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1124289,
      "endMs": 1127281
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "Hang on, boy! Daddy's coming to save you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1127392,
      "endMs": 1132091
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "D'oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1132197,
      "endMs": 1134062
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "Mom! I found Sideshow Bob's hideout! And I got a secret message to the police!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1134166,
      "endMs": 1138660
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "And I had a blimp fall on me! And I was in an atomic blast! But I'm okay now!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1138770,
      "endMs": 1142365
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Well, I wrecked the gate. But you don't hear me bragging. Now let's roll!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1142474,
      "endMs": 1146706
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Ah, for the days when aviation was a gentleman's pursuit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1151984,
      "endMs": 1154919
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "Back before everyJoe Sweat Sock could wedge himself behind a lunch tray... and jet off to Raleigh-Durham.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1155020,
      "endMs": 1161356
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Are you getting lots of bugs in your mouth too?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1161460,
      "endMs": 1164861
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Yes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1164963,
      "endMs": 1167397
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "Prepare to engage enemy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1168834,
      "endMs": 1171769
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "Bogie's air speed not sufficient for intercept. Suggest we get out and walk.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1171870,
      "endMs": 1175636
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "Jump, boy! I got you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1183115,
      "endMs": 1185106
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "I'm coming!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1185217,
      "endMs": 1188050
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "Now you, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1194860,
      "endMs": 1196987
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "You can't escape, Bob. If the tennis rackets don't get you, the pool skimmers will.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1197095,
      "endMs": 1200656
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "Oh, I- I never planned to escape.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1200766,
      "endMs": 1203564
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "You see, this is a kamikaze mission.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1203669,
      "endMs": 1205933
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "You and I are going to kill Krusty the Clown!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1206038,
      "endMs": 1209474
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "Kids, Itchy and Scratchy can't be here today.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1215714,
      "endMs": 1218080
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "But instead, we've got the next best thing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1218183,
      "endMs": 1221209
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "It's The Stingy and Battery Show.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1221320,
      "endMs": 1223982
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "They bite and light and bite and light and bite You know what I'm talking about.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1224089,
      "endMs": 1229823
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "Uh-oh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1229928,
      "endMs": 1232123
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "You can't kill Krusty. He made you what you are.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1232231,
      "endMs": 1234756
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Without him, you wouldn't even be called \"Sideshow. \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1234866,
      "endMs": 1238893
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "What the hell is that? A lawn mower?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1241440,
      "endMs": 1243408
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "Get out of the way, Krusty!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1245711,
      "endMs": 1247770
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "What is the freakin' holdup?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1255721,
      "endMs": 1257780
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "Die, Krusty!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1258824,
      "endMs": 1261224
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "Die- Oh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1261326,
      "endMs": 1263851
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "Ooh, sorry. Uh, we don't normally drive these in the Air Force.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1267165,
      "endMs": 1272364
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "Gotcha! Ya TV-hatin' mutant.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1272471,
      "endMs": 1276271
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "What is your major malfunction, Sideshow Bob?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1276375,
      "endMs": 1279071
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "Oh, my little sugar bun.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1279177,
      "endMs": 1282340
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "I'm so glad you're safe.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1282447,
      "endMs": 1284915
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "But- But- But- But, M-M-Mom!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1285017,
      "endMs": 1287884
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "You're embarrassing me in front of the army guys.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1287986,
      "endMs": 1290784
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "How ironic. My crusade against television has come to an end so formulaic... it could have spewed from the PowerBook of the laziest Hollywood hack.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1290889,
      "endMs": 1301194
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "Hey, everybody! I'm gonna haul ass to Lollapalooza!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1304536,
      "endMs": 1309030
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "Here we go again. Here we go again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1309141,
      "endMs": 1312008
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "Shh! www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1360826,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 7,
    "episode": 9
  }
}
